      "set_description": "<p><strong>【Set Bonus】</strong></p><p><strong>2 Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>When you Absorb damage, recover MP equal to the amount absorbed. Once per round.</p></li></ul><p><strong>3 Piece</strong></p><ul><li><p>When you Absorb <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"Item.5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-id=\"5XAuMMbDPlLzhJLw\" data-type=\"Item\" data-tooltip=\"Equippable Item Item\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: inherit; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; text-shadow: rgb(215, 169, 255) 0px 0px 4px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Bolt</span></strong></a></span></span> damage, gain 1 <strong>Spark of Life</strong>. Max <strong>3</strong> stacks.</p></li><li><p>When you would be reduced to 0 HP with <strong>3</strong> <strong>Spark of Life</strong>, spend them. Your HP becomes your <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-family: Signika, sans-serif\"><a class=\"content-link\" draggable=\"true\" data-link=\"\" data-uuid=\"JournalEntry.GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-id=\"GJevbCPM8cffm1QM\" data-type=\"JournalEntry\" data-tooltip=\"Journal Entry\" aria-describedby=\"tooltip\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(93, 20, 43) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); cursor: pointer; --content-link-background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); background-image: none !important; background-position: initial !important; background-size: initial !important; background-repeat: initial !important; background-attachment: initial !important; background-origin: initial !important; background-clip: initial !important; background-color: rgb(102, 102, 102); padding: 0px !important; border: none !important; border-radius: 2px; white-space: nowrap; word-break: break-all; color: rgb(25, 24, 19); font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; position: relative; top: 2px; font-family: Signika, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Crisis</span></strong></a></span></span> score instead.</p></li><li><p><strong>Spark of Life</strong> is lost at the end of the scene.</p></li></ul>",
